  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support Women in Law and Development in Africa (WILDAF) in Mali to promote women&#x2019;s empowerment and participation.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support work with Mali national NGO Women in Law and Development in Africa (WILDAF) to promote women&#x2019;s empowerment and participation, in peace and security by strengthening women&#x2019;s capacities in mediation, advocacy, social protection, and security governance, and supporting Women&apos;s Rights Organisations to participate in and respond to the Women, Peace, and Security Agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
